<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Haphazard — Workshop Editorial</title><style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:#f3efe5;color:#182019;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;line-height:1.5}.shell{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #26322a}.brand{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.05em;font-size:1.25rem}.brand i{color:#e94d28;font-style:normal}.nav{display:flex;gap:22px;font:700 .78rem Arial,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em}.nav a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.hero{min-height:74vh;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:56px;align-items:center;padding:70px 0}.kicker,.number,.label{font:800 .72rem Arial,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.18em}.kicker{color:#d94620;margin:0 0 22px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(4rem,8.7vw,8.6rem);line-height:.82;letter-spacing:-.075em;font-weight:500;margin:0;max-width:9ch}.hero h1 em{font-style:italic;font-weight:400}.intro{align-self:end;padding-bottom:18px}.intro p{font-size:1.25rem;max-width:36ch}.actions{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:28px;flex-wrap:wrap}.btn{border:1px solid #26322a;background:transparent;color:inherit;padding:12px 16px;text-decoration:none;font:800 .72rem Arial,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;cursor:pointer}.btn.primary{background:#182019;color:#f3efe5}.line{border-top:1px solid #26322a}.manifesto{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.36fr 1fr;gap:40px;padding:60px 0}.manifesto blockquote{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4vw,4.6rem);line-height:1.02;margin:0;letter-spacing:-.04em}.projects{padding:60px 0 100px}.project{display:grid;grid-template-columns:70px 1fr .85fr auto;gap:28px;align-items:start;padding:30px 0;border-top:1px solid #7d817b}.project:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid #7d817b}.project h2{margin:0;font-size:2.2rem;line-height:1}.project p{margin:0;color:#4a514a}.project a{color:inherit;font:800 .72rem Arial,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase}.stamp{border:1px solid #26322a;border-radius:50%;width:92px;height:92px;display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;transform:rotate(8deg);font:800 .63rem Arial,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;background:#f2b444}.switcher{position:fixed;right:18px;bottom:18px;background:#182019;color:#f3efe5;padding:14px;width:min(340px,calc(100% - 36px));box-shadow:8px 8px 0 #e94d28;z-index:4}.switcher strong{font:800 .68rem Arial,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em}.switcher p{font-size:1rem;margin:8px 0}.switcher button{background:transparent;border:1px solid #738078;color:#fff;padding:7px 10px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold}.switcher button:hover{background:#fff;color:#182019}footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:30px 0 110px;font:700 .8rem Arial,sans-serif}@media(max-width:760px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(3.8rem,17vw,6rem)}.manifesto{grid-template-columns:1fr}.project{grid-template-columns:42px 1fr}.project p,.project .stamp{grid-column:2}.nav{display:none}.shell{width:min(100% - 24px,1180px)}}
</style></head><body><header class="shell"><div class="brand">haphazard<i>.</i>dev</div><nav class="nav"><a href="#work">Work</a><a href="https://github.com/HaphazardDev">Lab notes ↗</a></nav></header><main><section class="hero shell"><div><p class="kicker">Independent developer workshop · Pacific Northwest</p><h1 id="hero">Small tools for <em>unruly</em> workflows.</h1></div><div class="intro"><p>I build sharp, practical software for the awkward parts of making software—worktrees, terminals, editors, and the seams between them.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="#work">See the work</a><a class="btn" href="https://github.com/corwinm">GitHub ↗</a></div></div></section><section class="line"><div class="manifesto shell"><div class="label">Working principle</div><blockquote>Good tools don’t need to change everything. They just need to remove the right bit of friction.</blockquote></div></section><section class="projects shell" id="work"><p class="kicker">On the bench</p><article class="project"><span class="number">01</span><h2>Arashi</h2><p>A worktree manager that makes a polyrepo behave like a monorepo while you work.</p><a href="https://arashi.haphazard.dev">Docs ↗</a></article><article class="project"><span class="number">02</span><h2>oil.code</h2><p>File operations inside VS Code, using the same editing habits you already have.</p><a href="https://github.com/corwinm/oil.code">Project ↗</a></article><article class="project"><span class="number">03</span><h2>coding-agents-tmux</h2><p>A control surface for many coding-agent sessions without leaving tmux.</p><a href="https://github.com/corwinm/coding-agents-tmux">Project ↗</a></article><article class="project"><span class="number">04</span><h2>pi extensions</h2><p>Small experiments that make a capable coding agent friendlier day to day.</p><div class="stamp">Built in<br>small batches</div></article></section></main><footer class="shell"><span>© Haphazard.dev</span><span>Make the rough edges useful.</span></footer><aside class="switcher"><strong>Try another headline</strong><p id="alt">Small tools for unruly workflows.</p><button id="next">Next line →</button></aside><script>const lines=['Small tools for unruly workflows.','Useful software, built the slightly hard way.','Tools for the parts of development that still feel awkward.','Make the rough edges useful.'];let i=0;document.querySelector('#next').onclick=()=>{i=(i+1)%lines.length;document.querySelector('#alt').textContent=lines[i];document.querySelector('#hero').innerHTML=lines[i].replace(/(unruly|slightly hard|awkward|rough edges)/,'<em>$1</em>')}</script></body></html>